Dingdong is an independent open source project by Jules / jamespapapa.

The SQLite record store and the versioned workflow, immutable run snapshot,
approval-resume, idempotency and retrospective contracts were adapted from
jamespapapa/moa at commit e22869b. Original user data and reference artifacts
are not included.

OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw), MIT licensed, is used as the
private gateway and tool execution host. This repository supplies the Dingdong
OpenClaw plugin; the host is installed separately at version 2026.9.7.
Its memory architecture and the hybrid/MMR/temporal-decay implementation at
commit c074824a27c96d3983043f9eeb33823cd1772d8c informed Dingdong's independently
implemented layered memory, lexical retrieval, diversity and decay policies.
See docs/openclaw-memory-benchmark.md for source links and measured limitations.

Model Context Protocol TypeScript SDK is used under its MIT license.
Google Fonts DM Sans and Noto Sans KR are served by Google Fonts under their
respective SIL Open Font Licenses. Fonts are not bundled in this repository.

GPT dots and ChatGPT are OpenAI products. Dingdong is not affiliated with or
endorsed by OpenAI. No model training or access to dots' internal private memory
is implied by this software.
